1
00:00:33,700 --> 00:00:35,980
You guys are all so careful.

2
00:00:36,660 --> 00:00:37,420
I have to say,

3
00:00:37,860 --> 00:00:38,920
you two are quite a match.

4
00:00:38,920 --> 00:00:40,740
No wonder Xu Qingdao
wanted to set you two up.

5
00:00:40,740 --> 00:00:41,540
Shut up.

6
00:00:58,720 --> 00:01:01,250
[Eclipse in the Lost City] [Episode 19]

7
00:01:07,220 --> 00:01:07,530
What...

8
00:01:07,530 --> 00:01:08,970
What's happening to me?

9
00:01:11,050 --> 00:01:11,640
Don't kill me.

10
00:01:11,640 --> 00:01:13,039
I don't know anything.

11
00:01:13,350 --> 00:01:14,270
I don't know.

12
00:01:14,289 --> 00:01:15,280
I don't have the antidote.

13
00:01:15,280 --> 00:01:15,960
Antidote?

14
00:01:16,460 --> 00:01:17,300
Antidote?

15
00:01:21,420 --> 00:01:22,380
What antidote?

16
00:01:22,480 --> 00:01:23,120
Wolf...

17
00:01:23,580 --> 00:01:24,900
Wolfbane antidote.

18
00:01:28,700 --> 00:01:29,539
Tell me.

19
00:01:29,820 --> 00:01:31,460
Who's behind you?

20
00:01:33,420 --> 00:01:34,270
Xu Qingdao.

21
00:01:34,470 --> 00:01:36,310
He's behind all of this.

22
00:01:36,340 --> 00:01:38,670
I just keep the maintenance doses for him.

23
00:01:39,060 --> 00:01:40,460
He has all the antidotes.

24
00:01:40,700 --> 00:01:42,460
I don't know anything else.

25
00:01:42,680 --> 00:01:44,270
Then why did the Shisha Gang members die

26
00:01:44,270 --> 00:01:46,850
after being injected
with the maintenance dose?

27
00:01:46,850 --> 00:01:49,890
The maintenance dose can
ease the effects of the poison,

28
00:01:49,890 --> 00:01:51,090
but there are risks.

29
00:01:51,460 --> 00:01:53,100
Everyone reacts differently.

30
00:01:53,100 --> 00:01:55,020
He was given S-02.

31
00:01:55,160 --> 00:01:57,960
His body couldn't handle it, so he died.

32
00:01:58,240 --> 00:01:59,759
What do the numbers mean?

33
00:02:00,860 --> 00:02:01,700
Talk.

34
00:02:02,140 --> 00:02:03,500
The higher the number,

35
00:02:04,020 --> 00:02:04,940
the stronger the drug's effects,

36
00:02:04,940 --> 00:02:06,350
the more the body can tolerate,

37
00:02:06,350 --> 00:02:07,900
and the more addictive it becomes.

38
00:02:07,900 --> 00:02:09,699
But once you survive it,

39
00:02:10,100 --> 00:02:12,960
the Wolfbane binds more effectively
with the body.

40
00:02:15,180 --> 00:02:17,110
Why did Xu Qingdao make you do this?

41
00:02:18,340 --> 00:02:19,380
Who is behind him?

42
00:02:21,540 --> 00:02:22,340
I...

43
00:02:22,860 --> 00:02:23,660
I don't know.

44
00:02:24,180 --> 00:02:25,380
I really don't know.

45
00:02:28,780 --> 00:02:30,079
I have a heart condition.

46
00:02:30,079 --> 00:02:31,400
Medicine...

47
00:02:32,340 --> 00:02:33,140
Where is it?

48
00:02:33,850 --> 00:02:34,650
Medicine...

49
00:02:38,740 --> 00:02:39,540
Save me.

50
00:02:39,730 --> 00:02:41,190
I'll tell you everything.

51
00:02:44,880 --> 00:02:45,680
Give it to me.

52
00:02:46,520 --> 00:02:47,320
Tell me.

53
00:02:51,890 --> 00:02:53,140
What does the antidote look like?

54
00:02:53,140 --> 00:02:53,860
The...

55
00:02:54,100 --> 00:02:55,460
The antidote is...

56
00:02:56,100 --> 00:02:56,900
Blue...

57
00:02:57,500 --> 00:02:58,300
Blue...

58
00:03:16,500 --> 00:03:18,500
He definitely knows more than this.

59
00:03:18,940 --> 00:03:21,120
Looks like we'll have to take our time
interrogating him.

60
00:03:21,120 --> 00:03:23,720
How about we take him back
to the Qingtian Gang?

61
00:03:33,100 --> 00:03:33,980
What did you take?

62
00:03:33,980 --> 00:03:34,780
Spit it out.

63
00:03:34,820 --> 00:03:36,350
This isn't heart medicine.

64
00:03:36,820 --> 00:03:38,880
He planned to kill himself all along.

65
00:03:51,940 --> 00:03:52,740
Xu Yin.

66
00:04:02,980 --> 00:04:04,140
You killed him?

67
00:04:06,520 --> 00:04:07,580
He killed himself.

68
00:04:09,680 --> 00:04:10,480
Hurry up.

69
00:04:11,940 --> 00:04:13,800
See if we can find any other clues.

70
00:04:19,860 --> 00:04:20,899
Strange.

71
00:04:21,820 --> 00:04:23,860
Why have the private accounts been
losing so much money these past few months?

72
00:04:22,610 --> 00:04:23,920
[Ningcheng Railway Station—
Western Medicine Cargo List]

73
00:04:23,940 --> 00:04:25,200
[Ningcheng Railway Station—Imported
Western Military Medicine Cargo List]

74
00:04:28,060 --> 00:04:31,060
So the hospital switched
to a new equipment supplier,

75
00:04:31,340 --> 00:04:32,980
cutting the director out
of his usual supply deals,

76
00:04:32,980 --> 00:04:34,909
and costing him a lot in kickbacks.

77
00:04:35,720 --> 00:04:37,980
They are all working for the foreigners.

78
00:04:38,260 --> 00:04:40,450
Back then, to curry favor
with the foreigners

79
00:04:40,450 --> 00:04:42,140
and become the vice president
of the chamber of commerce,

80
00:04:42,140 --> 00:04:43,340
Xu Qingdao tampered with the arrangements.

81
00:04:43,340 --> 00:04:45,140
He replaced the original suppliers

82
00:04:45,140 --> 00:04:46,260
with them.

83
00:04:48,159 --> 00:04:49,640
They already had a grudge.

84
00:04:52,500 --> 00:04:54,100
Then we've got an easy way in.

85
00:04:54,100 --> 00:04:55,700
You want to frame Xu Qingdao?

86
00:04:57,460 --> 00:04:58,500
Interesting.

87
00:04:59,060 --> 00:04:59,659
True.

88
00:04:59,659 --> 00:05:01,620
Since things have already come this far,

89
00:05:01,620 --> 00:05:04,020
we might as well
muddy the waters a bit more.

90
00:05:04,780 --> 00:05:05,740
But...

91
00:05:06,420 --> 00:05:08,280
what evidence are we going to use?

92
00:05:20,180 --> 00:05:21,040
You forgot?

93
00:05:21,110 --> 00:05:22,830
Xu Qingdao wants my kidney.

94
00:05:23,130 --> 00:05:26,330
Before the surgery,
blood needs to be drawn for matching.

95
00:05:26,340 --> 00:05:28,260
The sample will be kept for a while.

96
00:05:27,190 --> 00:05:28,150
[Xu Qingdao]

97
00:05:47,900 --> 00:05:48,710
All done.

98
00:05:55,930 --> 00:05:58,690
[Ningcheng Police Station]

99
00:05:59,380 --> 00:06:00,180
Director,

100
00:06:00,580 --> 00:06:02,780
the director of Renji Hospital is dead.

101
00:06:02,820 --> 00:06:03,620
What?

102
00:06:05,780 --> 00:06:08,620
Don't let this leak out,

103
00:06:08,740 --> 00:06:10,780
especially to the press.

104
00:06:11,990 --> 00:06:12,950
Think about it.

105
00:06:13,020 --> 00:06:14,700
I just came back from a meeting
in the provincial capital,

106
00:06:14,700 --> 00:06:16,320
and now we've got a dead body
on our hands.

107
00:06:16,320 --> 00:06:17,520
This is gonna kill me.

108
00:06:17,940 --> 00:06:19,220
Not a word.

109
00:06:19,320 --> 00:06:21,520
If you do, this quarter's bonus is gone.

110
00:06:21,820 --> 00:06:23,060
We need to keep this under wraps.

111
00:06:23,060 --> 00:06:23,700
Got it?

112
00:06:24,460 --> 00:06:25,300
Yes.

113
00:06:25,830 --> 00:06:26,270
Yes.

114
00:06:26,300 --> 00:06:27,900
But do you want to take a look

115
00:06:27,920 --> 00:06:30,320
at the results of our evidence collection?

116
00:06:32,020 --> 00:06:32,659
Right, right, right.

117
00:06:32,659 --> 00:06:33,340
Who did it?

118
00:06:34,300 --> 00:06:36,000
We found Xu Qingdao's cufflink

119
00:06:36,000 --> 00:06:37,440
on the director.

120
00:06:37,980 --> 00:06:39,180
And this report

121
00:06:39,920 --> 00:06:42,280
shows that the blood found on the director

122
00:06:42,830 --> 00:06:44,909
matches Xu Qingdao's blood type.

123
00:06:45,140 --> 00:06:47,180
So I suspect it was murder.

124
00:06:47,600 --> 00:06:48,760
Stop, stop, stop.

125
00:06:51,420 --> 00:06:53,780
Neither of them is easy to mess with.

126
00:06:55,780 --> 00:06:56,860
Here's what we'll do.

127
00:06:56,860 --> 00:06:59,420
Just say there's not enough evidence.

128
00:07:01,300 --> 00:07:01,860
Yes.

129
00:07:07,140 --> 00:07:09,460
[Blood Comparison Test Report]

130
00:07:10,210 --> 00:07:11,130
Sir,

131
00:07:11,300 --> 00:07:12,980
everything has been arranged.

132
00:07:12,980 --> 00:07:16,010
We've also kept the hospital incident
under wraps.

133
00:07:16,900 --> 00:07:18,140
Xu Qingdao

134
00:07:18,820 --> 00:07:20,880
still doesn't know you've found out.

135
00:07:21,480 --> 00:07:23,320
Not a word will leak out.

136
00:07:24,060 --> 00:07:26,180
Xu Qingdao has been asking around

137
00:07:26,380 --> 00:07:28,780
about who blocked his way
into the chamber of commerce.

138
00:07:28,780 --> 00:07:30,460
He did suspect the director.

139
00:07:30,620 --> 00:07:32,880
After all, for that extra 30% in profits,

140
00:07:33,100 --> 00:07:36,420
he promised to replace the equipment
in every hospital in Ningcheng

141
00:07:36,420 --> 00:07:37,880
with foreign-made goods.

142
00:07:38,300 --> 00:07:39,100
That meant

143
00:07:39,760 --> 00:07:42,870
the director wouldn't get
a single penny in kickbacks.

144
00:07:43,380 --> 00:07:46,380
I didn't expect him to be so bold.

145
00:07:47,110 --> 00:07:48,350
Call him

146
00:07:48,780 --> 00:07:50,240
and tell him to come see me.

147
00:07:50,540 --> 00:07:51,340
Yes.

148
00:08:05,140 --> 00:08:06,340
According to the director,

149
00:08:06,340 --> 00:08:09,500
Xu Qingdao has been running
an experiment involving the Wolfbane.

150
00:08:09,500 --> 00:08:11,230
What exactly does he want to do?

151
00:08:11,540 --> 00:08:13,270
Maybe he doesn't know, either.

152
00:08:13,540 --> 00:08:14,340
Makes sense.

153
00:08:14,900 --> 00:08:16,660
The Shisha Gang is just a sharp knife.

154
00:08:16,660 --> 00:08:17,860
If we want the answer,

155
00:08:18,180 --> 00:08:21,640
we must catch the person
holding the knife as soon as possible.

156
00:08:22,500 --> 00:08:24,160
I'll be discharged tomorrow.

157
00:08:27,580 --> 00:08:28,420
You still have a fever.

158
00:08:28,420 --> 00:08:29,160
You need to get some rest.

159
00:08:29,160 --> 00:08:30,490
I can't wait any longer.

160
00:08:33,500 --> 00:08:34,860
The longer we leave this unsolved,

161
00:08:34,860 --> 00:08:37,059
the more dangerous Ningcheng becomes.

162
00:08:41,010 --> 00:08:41,770
Alright.

163
00:08:42,309 --> 00:08:43,909
Got it, Officer Shen.

164
00:08:48,650 --> 00:08:50,310
A little bribe for the savior.

165
00:09:15,100 --> 00:09:15,900
Tianbai.

166
00:09:17,140 --> 00:09:19,740
I'm relieved to see you're okay.

167
00:09:20,620 --> 00:09:21,620
Thank you, Chief.

168
00:09:23,060 --> 00:09:24,100
Don't mention it.

169
00:09:24,540 --> 00:09:27,580
No need to be so formal with me.

170
00:09:27,900 --> 00:09:29,340
We'll be family soon.

171
00:09:32,220 --> 00:09:33,460
Tea gets weaker

172
00:09:34,300 --> 00:09:36,780
after being brewed too many times.

173
00:09:37,900 --> 00:09:40,430
Sitting in the same position
for over a decade

174
00:09:41,540 --> 00:09:42,660
gets boring.

175
00:09:44,440 --> 00:09:45,640
You are right, Chief.

176
00:09:46,060 --> 00:09:47,490
Water flows downhill,

177
00:09:47,780 --> 00:09:50,180
but people climb upward.

178
00:09:52,540 --> 00:09:53,850
Sometimes,

179
00:09:53,980 --> 00:09:56,020
you just have to bow your head.

180
00:09:57,180 --> 00:09:59,300
The Shisha Gang may look powerful,

181
00:09:59,780 --> 00:10:01,300
but for all these years,

182
00:10:01,620 --> 00:10:05,700
I've always had someone
more powerful breathing down my neck.

183
00:10:07,980 --> 00:10:11,020
I call him... Sir.

184
00:10:13,900 --> 00:10:14,900
Sir?

185
00:10:19,020 --> 00:10:19,980
He

186
00:10:21,440 --> 00:10:23,000
helped me a lot once.

187
00:10:23,800 --> 00:10:26,640
But I don't owe him anything anymore.

188
00:10:37,100 --> 00:10:39,700
After drinking leftover tea
for so many years,

189
00:10:39,980 --> 00:10:41,460
it's time for a fresh pot.

190
00:10:42,860 --> 00:10:43,660
Tianbai,

191
00:10:44,300 --> 00:10:45,960
do you understand what I mean?

192
00:10:47,380 --> 00:10:48,580
Rest assured, Chief.

193
00:10:48,940 --> 00:10:50,660
I'll give everything I have

194
00:10:50,660 --> 00:10:52,980
to the Shisha Gang and to you.

195
00:10:55,380 --> 00:10:56,180
Good.

196
00:10:56,870 --> 00:10:57,570
Father.

197
00:10:58,560 --> 00:10:59,240
Yin?

198
00:11:13,840 --> 00:11:14,850
Miss Xu,

199
00:11:15,030 --> 00:11:15,810
let me do it.

200
00:11:21,250 --> 00:11:21,850
Father,

201
00:11:21,940 --> 00:11:23,630
I have a favor to ask of you.

202
00:11:23,660 --> 00:11:24,460
What is it?

203
00:11:24,860 --> 00:11:26,280
Your birthday is coming up.

204
00:11:26,280 --> 00:11:28,020
I ordered you a suit
from a newly opened tailor shop

205
00:11:28,020 --> 00:11:29,420
in the concession.

206
00:11:29,570 --> 00:11:31,840
If you have time this afternoon,
you can go try it on.

207
00:11:31,840 --> 00:11:33,620
If it doesn't fit, they can alter it.

208
00:11:33,620 --> 00:11:34,680
This afternoon...

209
00:11:36,070 --> 00:11:36,750
Chief.

210
00:11:37,180 --> 00:11:40,180
The owner of that tailor shop
is Howard's brother.

211
00:11:40,280 --> 00:11:42,340
He only moved to Ningcheng recently.

212
00:11:42,340 --> 00:11:43,820
Howard?

213
00:11:44,300 --> 00:11:47,360
The director
of the Industrial and Commercial Bureau.

214
00:11:53,340 --> 00:11:54,080
Yin,

215
00:11:54,450 --> 00:11:55,420
that's very thoughtful of you.

216
00:11:55,420 --> 00:11:56,350
I'll go with you.

217
00:11:57,420 --> 00:11:58,180
Tianbai,

218
00:11:58,370 --> 00:11:59,230
you come along, too.

219
00:11:59,230 --> 00:11:59,990
Okay.

220
00:12:04,460 --> 00:12:06,220
I've cut the phone line.

221
00:12:04,740 --> 00:12:07,740
[12 hours ago]

222
00:12:06,450 --> 00:12:07,610
No one can get through.

223
00:12:07,610 --> 00:12:08,860
They can only send messages by letter,

224
00:12:08,860 --> 00:12:10,720
and I've intercepted those, too.

225
00:12:10,810 --> 00:12:13,610
Unfortunately, I still can't
find the messenger.

226
00:12:13,760 --> 00:12:16,390
[2 p.m. tomorrow, Dashijie]

227
00:12:17,820 --> 00:12:18,580
As expected,

228
00:12:18,580 --> 00:12:19,660
we guessed right.

229
00:12:19,780 --> 00:12:22,780
The director and Xu Qingdao
are both working for Sir.

230
00:12:23,140 --> 00:12:24,340
The director is dead,

231
00:12:24,500 --> 00:12:26,620
and Xu Qingdao's blood
was found at the scene.

232
00:12:26,620 --> 00:12:27,480
No matter what,

233
00:12:27,980 --> 00:12:30,440
Sir whould confront him
and demand answers.

234
00:12:30,980 --> 00:12:32,910
Xu Qingdao hasn't noticed, right?

235
00:12:33,860 --> 00:12:35,860
The police have kept it under wraps.

236
00:12:35,990 --> 00:12:37,620
That old man still doesn't know

237
00:12:37,620 --> 00:12:39,540
he's being made the scapegoat.

238
00:12:41,740 --> 00:12:43,360
I was planning to keep the director alive

239
00:12:43,360 --> 00:12:45,290
and see what we could get out of him.

240
00:12:45,340 --> 00:12:46,600
But now that he's dead,

241
00:12:46,980 --> 00:12:48,640
we'll just have to play along.

242
00:12:51,900 --> 00:12:55,420
You want to drive a wedge
between Xu Qingdao and Sir?

243
00:12:56,220 --> 00:12:56,940
Exactly.

244
00:12:57,100 --> 00:12:59,540
We need to make each of them
believe the other is about to make a move.

245
00:12:59,540 --> 00:13:01,660
Once there's a crack
in their relationship,

246
00:13:01,660 --> 00:13:03,120
they'll leave an opening.

247
00:13:07,160 --> 00:13:10,280
We absolutely cannot
let them meet tomorrow.

248
00:13:11,260 --> 00:13:12,760
I'll leave the Shisha Gang to you.

249
00:13:12,760 --> 00:13:16,240
I'll go to Dashijie and lie in wait.
